OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry bright start then cloud
OL,6,Fand showers soon reaching western
OL,7,Fcounties spreading across to Belfast
OL,8,Fand the east by the afternoon, some
OL,9,Fheavy with thunder possible.
OL,10,FBrightening up again in the afternoon
OL,11,Fwith sunny intervals and more
OL,12,Fscattered showers.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FThere will be a mixture of
OL,15,Fclear spells and a few showers.
OL,16,FOvernight some more frequent showers
OL,17,Freaching the north coast. A windy
OL,18,Fnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
