OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FBright or sunny intervals and
OL,6,Fshowers, some heavy. Fresh to strong
OL,7,Fwesterly winds. On the cool side.
OL,8,
OL,9,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FBright
OL,10,Fon Wednesday with some sunny spells
OL,11,Fdeveloping. Rain spreading from the
OL,12,Fwest on Thursday. Then brighter again
OL,13,Fon Friday with some sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
